# 构建上下文只保留镜像真正需要的文件。
#
# compose 的 context 是仓库根目录，如果不限制会把 common/temp/node_modules
# （数百 MB）一起发给 daemon；镜像只拷贝 dist 与 package.json。
*
!apps/qqbot/dist/**
!apps/qqbot/package.json
!apps/agent-svc/dist/**
!apps/agent-svc/package.json
!apps/github-svc/dist/**
!apps/github-svc/package.json
!deploy/Dockerfile.qqbot
!deploy/Dockerfile.agent-svc
!deploy/Dockerfile.github-svc
!deploy/Dockerfile.egress-proxy
!deploy/tinyproxy/**
!deploy/egress-allowlist-docker.txt
